%% Card 1 contract (feeds Card 3): Timer Begin/Finish state machine
%% BACKEND IS PYTHON — FastAPI in backend-python/
%% Endpoints: POST /api/timer/begin  {task_id}
%%            POST /api/timer/finish {task_id}
%% Handler: backend-python/app/routes/timer.py (Depends resolve_tenant)
%% Works on any task type (task|session).
%% Income is derived from actual tracked time, not scheduled duration.

stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> idle: task.remaining = estimate\nactive_started_at = null

  idle --> running: POST /api/timer/begin\nactive_started_at = NOW()\nINSERT time_entries open row

  running --> idle: POST /api/timer/finish\nelapsed = NOW() - active_started_at\nremaining -= elapsed\nclose time_entries row

  running --> conflict: POST /api/timer/begin\n409 already running
  conflict --> running: (no-op)

  idle --> guardFail: POST /api/timer/finish\nno active timer\n409 nothing to finish
  guardFail --> idle: (no-op)

  idle --> done: remaining <= 0\nmark Complete
  done --> incomeHook: type = session?\nSUM(time_entries.duration x hourly_rate)\nINSERT income_records row
  incomeHook --> [*]
  done --> [*]: type = task\n(no income rule)

  

  note right of running
    Week 1: no pause / no task-switch
    Edge cases deferred to Card 3
  end note

  note right of incomeHook
    Income = actual tracked time, not scheduled\nTimer is the source of truth
    Feeds Card 7 directly
  end note